00:03:40,714 --> 00:03:46,714
Say hola to his little friends.

2
00:07:21,428 --> 00:07:27,428
Puss in Boots: The Last Wish is a animation, adventure,
fantasy film directed by Joel Crawford.

3
00:11:02,142 --> 00:11:08,142
Puss in Boots discovers that his passion for adventure has taken its toll: He has burned
through eight of his nine lives, leaving him with only one life left.

4
00:14:42,857 --> 00:14:48,857
Puss sets out on an epic journey to find the mythical
Last Wish and restore his nine lives.

5
