Puss in Boots (voice), played by Antonio Banderas.

6
00:22:04,285 --> 00:22:10,285
Kitty Softpaws (voice), played by Salma Hayek Pinault.

7
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:51,000
Perrito (voice), played by Harvey Guillén.

8
00:29:25,714 --> 00:29:31,714
Wolf (voice), played by Wagner Moura.

9
